    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d505-a25">

                <pb facs="0569" n="519" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg519"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Document No. 25.—From the legation of Portugal in
                        Buenos Ayres.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-04"><hi rendition="#small-caps">April</hi> 4,
                        1894</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Epidemic yellow fever corvette <hi rendition="#italic">Mindello:</hi></p>
                <p>Argentine Government in diplomatic note of to-day asks me to solicit with the
                    greatest urgency instructions from the Government either to disembark the
                    passengers for the lazaretto or to remove the corvettes from Argentine waters
                    without the least delay. General indignation against the retention of the
                    refugees on board is raised in the press. Under such conditions I beg of you
                    orders to answer the note. The situation on board can not be more desperate. It
                    has become impossible to wait for a war transport here.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Faria.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
